tr-freedv: a Rust port of the FreeDV 700D and 700E modes
========================================================

This crate is a translation into Rust of parts of Codec 2, release 1.2.0
(https://github.com/drowe67/codec2), the reference implementation of FreeDV:

  src/ofdm.c, src/ofdm_mode.c, src/ofdm_internal.h   OFDM modem (David Rowe, Steve Sampson)
  src/freedv_700.c, src/freedv_api.c                 FreeDV framing and receive logic (David Rowe)
  src/interldpc.c, src/gp_interleaver.c              LDPC framing, interleaver (David Rowe)
  src/varicode.c, src/varicode_table.h               text channel code (David Rowe; table: Clint Turner,
                                                     Peter Martinez, the PSK31 varicode)
  src/mpdecode_core.c                                LDPC decoder (Matthew C. Valenti, Rohit Iyer
                                                     Seshadri, David Rowe; from the Iterative
                                                     Solutions Coded Modulation Library)
  src/HRA_112_112.c, src/HRA_56_56.c                 LDPC codes (Bill Cowley VK5DSP)

