Modified 2026 by Franz Schöning, https://www.schoning.com: translated from C to
Rust; no heap; only the 700D and 700E voice modes; real-valued receive buffer;
exact phi function in the LDPC decoder instead of the table; no transmit
clipper or band-pass filter yet; own sample-rate converter.

